# CommunityWatch (Windows)

Install the latest client for Windows.

## Download

- **Installer:** [releases/CommunityWatch-Setup-{{VERSION}}.exe](releases/CommunityWatch-Setup-{{VERSION}}.exe)
- **Integrity (SHA256):** [releases/CommunityWatch-Setup-{{VERSION}}.exe.sha256](releases/CommunityWatch-Setup-{{VERSION}}.exe.sha256)

Verify after download (PowerShell):

```powershell
Get-FileHash .\releases\CommunityWatch-Setup-{{VERSION}}.exe -Algorithm SHA256
```

Compare the hash to the value in the `.sha256` file.

## Website

[https://comunitywatch.com](https://comunitywatch.com)

